<title>INDIA: India SKF 96/97 net up at 291 mln.</title>
<headline>India SKF 96/97 net up at 291 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	  (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 291.0  vs   232.0</p>
<p>    Net sales		3,995.00 vs 3,723.00</p>
<p>    Dividend (in rupees)    40.0  vs    35.0</p>
<p>    Misc. income	     125.0  vs   120.0</p>
<p>    Total income	   4,120.0  vs 3,843.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation	     329.0  vs   311.0</p>
<p>    Interest		   232.0  vs   219.0</p>
<p>    Tax			  295.0  vs   250.0</p>
<p>    Shr (rupees)	     116.0  vs    92.0</p>
<p>Note: SKF Bearings is a major Indian manufacturer of ball-bearings.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
